## 🚀 Featured Projects

<br/>

### 🔐 OpenID Mini &nbsp; — &nbsp; _Identity Provider from Scratch_

> Built a fully functional **OAuth 2.0 + OpenID Connect** authorization server from scratch to deeply understand how "Login with Google" works internally — not just how to integrate it.

| Feature                                      | Status |
| -------------------------------------------- | :----: |
| OAuth 2.0 Authorization Code Flow            |   ✅   |
| OpenID Connect core spec                     |   ✅   |
| Client registration & consent flow           |   ✅   |
| Access token & ID token issuance             |   ✅   |
| `/.well-known/openid-configuration` endpoint |   ✅   |
| `/.well-known/jwks.json` endpoint            |   ✅   |
| `RS256` signed ID tokens                     |   ✅   |
| JWKS-based token verification                |   ✅   |
| Separate React frontend + Express backend    |   ✅   |

**Stack →** `Node.js` `Express.js` `React` `Vite` `JWT` `RS256` `JWKS` `OAuth 2.0` `OpenID Connect` `HTTP-only Cookies`

[![View on GitHub](https://img.shields.io/badge/View%20Repo-%23121011.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/kunalbhanuse/openID-mini)

